        "description": "v2.logistics.ship_order\nUse this api to initiate logistics including arrange pickup, dropoff or shipment for non-integrated logistic channels. Should call v2.logistics.get_shipping_parameter to fetch all required param first. It's recommended to initiate logistics one hour after the orders were placed.\nAuthorization: Shop; existing bound shop and Seller In House System app. Platform market, enrollment and method permissions still apply."
